From 36754bf5c24618937c877ba1f36792b6b86fa531 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Navid Ghahremani <ghahramani.navid@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:12:42 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] sanechips: add ZX279128S target

Add the Cortex-A9 target, kernel configuration and shared image helpers.
Carry the Linux SoC and driver series and three prerequisite ZTE
backports against Linux 6.18. Keep the board DTS and device setup in the
following commit.

The target uses generic SPI NAND and UBI for bad block management and
wear leveling.

Signed-off-by: Navid Ghahremani <ghahramani.navid@gmail.com>
