--- /dev/null
+++ b/target/linux/sanechips/patches-6.18/019-net-phy-Add-Sanechips-ZX5201-PHY-support.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,42 @@
+From 1c829b6bfb118ae87cff5abd708c3ecf583fc985 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Navid Ghahremani <ghahramani.navid@gmail.com>
+Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 07:49:28 +0100
+Subject: [PATCH 16/24] net: phy: Add Sanechips ZX5201 PHY support
+
+Initialize the external WAN PHY and its SerDes path; generic PHY support
